{"id":"flatpak-documents.1","n":"flatpak-documents","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"flatpak","ver":"1.12.9-4.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/f/flatpak-1.12.9-4.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/flatpak-documents.1.gz","sha256":"4e49a227932b9a23416152751768dbd0901ed6202c9de77fd1033b525f8923a3","date":"","origin":"flatpak"}},"nopt":{"r":3},"desc":"List exported files","r":[["NAME","<p>flatpak-documents - List exported files</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>flatpak documents</b> [OPTION...] [APPID]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Lists exported files, with their document id and the full path to their origin. If an APPID is specified, only the files exported to this app are listed.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<p>The following options are understood:</p> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h</b>, <b>--help</b></dt><dd>Show help options and exit.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-v</b>, <b>--verbose</b></dt><dd>Print debug information during command processing.</dd></dl> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--ostree-verbose</b></dt><dd>Print OSTree debug information during command processing.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>flatpak</b>(1), <b>flatpak-document-export</b>(1), <b>flatpak-document-unexport</b>(1), <b>flatpak-document-info</b>(1)</p>"]]}